; INFRA-075: every action in this directory -- unit tests and the rules that run the real
; `sol` binary -- gets a data home inside the build tree. Sol keeps run logs and state under
; $XDG_DATA_HOME/sol (else ~/.local/share/sol), pruned to the latest 20 across all commands,
; so a test that inherited the operator's environment deleted real qualification runs.
; Relative on purpose: it resolves inside whichever build or temp directory the action runs in.

(env
 (_
  (env-vars
   (XDG_DATA_HOME .sol-test-data))))

